<article class="env-definition" id="11E39F">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/11E39F">Definition <span data-tag="11E39F">2.4.1.1</span>.</a>morphism!$p$-CartesianCartesian edge Let $p: X \rightarrow S$ be an inner fibration of simplicial sets. Let $f: x \rightarrow y$ be an edge in $X$. We shall say that $f$ is <em>$p$-Cartesian</em> if the induced map </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  X_{/f} \rightarrow X_{/y} \times _{ S_{/p(y)} } S_{/p(f)} \]
</div>
  <p> is a trivial Kan fibration. </p>
</article>